{title: 013 - New Songs of Celebration Render}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Worship}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[G]New songs [C/G]of [D/F#]celebration [C]render
[Bm]To Him who [Em/B]has [Am]great [G]wonders done.
[G]Love [C/G]sits [D/F#]enthroned [G]in [F#dim]ageless [Am]splendor:
[C]Come, [G/D]and [D7/C]adore [A7]the [D/A]mighty [Bm]One.
[Bm]He [C]has [G]made [C]known [D]His [Em/B]great [D/A]salvation
[G]Which all [C]His [D/A]friends [C/G]with [Em/B]joy [Am/E]confess:
[G]He has [Am]revealed [G/B]to [D7]every nation
[C/E]His everlasting [A7]righteousness.

Verse 2:
[G]Joyfully, [D/F#]heartily [D7/C]resounding,
[Bm]Let every [Em/B]instrument [D]and [G]voice
[G]Peal [C/G]out [D/F#]the [G]praise of [Am]grace abounding
[C]Calling [G/D]the [D7/C]whole [A7]world [D/A]to [Em/B]rejoice.
[Bm]Trumpets [G]and [C]organs, [Em/B]set [D/A]in [Em/B]motion
[G]Such sounds [C]as [D/A]make [C/G]the [Em/B]heavens [Bm/F#]ring;
[G]All things [Am]that [G/B]live [C/E]in [D7]earth [Em]and [D7/C]ocean,
[C/E]Make music [D7/C]for [C]your [A7]mighty [Em/B]King.

Verse 3:
[G]Rivers [C/G]and [D/F#]seas [Em/B]and [G]torrents [C]roaring,
[Bm]Honor the [Em/B]Lord [Am]with [G]wild [D]acclaim;
[G]Mountains [D/F#]and [G]stones [F#dim]look [Am]up adoring,
[C]And [G/D]find [D7/C]a [Em/B]voice [A7]to [D/A]praise [Em/B]His [Bm]name.
[Bm]Righteous, [G]commanding, [Em/B]ever glorious,
[G]Praises [C]be [D/A]His [C/G]that [Em/B]never [Bm/F#]cease:
[G]Just is [Am]our [G/B]God, [C/E]whose [D7]truth [Em]victorious,
[C/E]Establishes the [A7]world [D/A]in [Em/B]peace.
